{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/0cdb3608f16a182929ef3d41dd613803.avif?t=1744717806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras_big/0cdb3608f16a182929ef3d41dd613803.avif?t=1744717806 width=800 height=235 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOY SCRAPPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique multiplayer horror and escape game for 2 to 16 players! Become a crazy clown and hunt down your prey, or play as a toy and try to survive the madness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/de85fd890f3b3c3f6bb6cda2cebb12a4.poster.avif?t=1744717806\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/de85fd890f3b3c3f6bb6cda2cebb12a4.webm?t=1744717806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/de85fd890f3b3c3f6bb6cda2cebb12a4.mp4?t=1744717806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE MADNESS, STAY ALIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a toy caught in the middle of crazy clowns, hide and try to stay alive without being caught. Increase your chances of survival with special abilities!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decoy</strong>: Create a copy of yourself to confuse your pursuers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prop</strong>: Turn into an object and blend into your surroundings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusion</strong>: Spawn 8 copies of yourself to vanish in the chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisibility</strong>: Disappear completely and escape without a trace!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/19328266f41f2ccb6a412227e9251f26.poster.avif?t=1744717806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/19328266f41f2ccb6a412227e9251f26.webm?t=1744717806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/19328266f41f2ccb6a412227e9251f26.mp4?t=1744717806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A CRAZY CLOWN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a clown, your goal is to find the hidden toys on the map. Hunt them down and turn them to your side! Use your special abilities to trap them!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trap</strong>: Place a trap on the ground and wait for them to get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sense</strong>: Feel nearby enemies and locate them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/95e3ce144df4817c615cd235fb436a0f.poster.avif?t=1744717806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/95e3ce144df4817c615cd235fb436a0f.webm?t=1744717806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/95e3ce144df4817c615cd235fb436a0f.mp4?t=1744717806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOY SCRAPPERS</strong> offers an unforgettable experience filled with laughter and thrills to share with friends. <strong>Will you be the hunter or the hunted?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WHERE IT ALL BEGAN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/c88c4b378f43b44c0869157e646053dbdac61d43.jpg"},{"name":"CREATE A LOBBY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/bf2f8636b93c5ffd88e88138030194262b1d41d9.jpg"},{"name":"JOIN A LOBBY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/8a00589015838fe2ec74368c14dd9bae506d7b3e.jpg"},{"name":"WHO IS THE KILLER?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/304e5c5e2cdfefbe42e9c4978b842dc8c36341c0.jpg"},{"name":"RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/3a932c76895cb50e1804eadea5da32e48d7da6ed.jpg"},{"name":"YOU GOT HIM!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/6fb93561c49d411558a7b0fbd7425ee0a8b11b8e.jpg"},{"name":"YOU GOT CAUGHT!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/b975213386cda52ff60f0ac4f2c006d0ed07bf38.jpg"},{"name":"YOU ARE SAVED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/c614700e3446c964dc57c22491b72014d8a57df5.jpg"},{"name":"WE CAUGHT THEM ALL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/3d17be51ada2d8d74abfbaf120f1ca97a2b9343f.jpg"},{"name":"CAMOUFLAGE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/a0a91604c6fd7df82509411150b3d3e6baffd680.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457790?t=1744717806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744717806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/4221a53423efb8354c184651ee55fb0e12281f97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744717806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/4221a53423efb8354c184651ee55fb0e12281f97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744717806","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"Toy Scrappers\" is a thrilling chase-based horror game where some players takes on the role of a killer attempting to capture other players. The game includes:\r\n\r\nHorror Elements: Jump scares, dark environments, and unexpected events designed to create a tense atmosphere.\r\n\r\nViolence: The killer performs attack animations on toy characters. These animations involve mild violence but do not include blood or excessive gore.\r\n\r\nPsychological Tension: Players may experience heightened tension due to the thrill of escaping or being pursued.\r\n\r\nThe game does not include sexual content, sexual violence, drug use, alcohol, or self-harm. However, it may not be suitable for players sensitive to intense horror or suspenseful themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/0cdb3608f16a182929ef3d41dd613803.avif?t=1744717806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras_big/0cdb3608f1